Tessera plugins (ported to Java)
--------------------------------

Flip clock, Tap sound, Waste collection, Voice assistant and Bluetooth proxy (https://github.com/MaxGramser/tessera-plugins)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Max Gramser. MIT License. Tap sound's two sounds (assets/tap.wav, assets/step.wav) are the
  plugin's own files.
  Voice assistant's two sounds (assets/assist_wake.ogg, assets/assist_thinking.ogg) are its wake.wav and
  thinking.wav, made smaller (22 kHz mono Ogg Vorbis).

Screen camera (https://github.com/MaxGramser/tessera-plugins, plugins/screen_camera)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Max Gramser. GNU General Public License v3.0 only, which section 13 of this project's AGPL v3
  lets it be combined with. ScreenCamera.java and core/Sensing.java reimplement its behaviour in Java (no code is
  copied): its entities and settings by name, light level and motion from a coarse grid with the three-second pause
  after a light switches, motion waking the screen, and the core's camera dot (Tessera's capture_dot.h).
  core/Rtsp.java reimplements its video server (components/screen_video, rtsp_server.cpp): RTSP with RTP over the
  connection, H.264 as RFC 6184, sender reports, and the password tessera_video works out from the API key.

Thermo dial (https://github.com/alexcoscia/tessera-thermo-dial, as listed in Tessera's plugin index)
  Copyright (c) 2026 Alex Coscia. MIT License.

AV wall panel controls (https://github.com/MrEcosse/Tessera-Plugin-AV-Wall-Panel-Controls)
  Copyright (c) 2026 MrEcosse. MIT License.

Each is redrawn in Java from the plugin's C++ (its layout, rules and words); the MIT licences' notices apply to those
parts.

